sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Angular
    participant AuthController
    participant Handler as Auth command handlers
    participant Email as Email service
    participant Db as MovieShopDb

    User->>Angular: Register
    Angular->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/register
    AuthController->>Handler: RegisterCommand
    Handler->>Db: Create user and confirmation token hash
    Handler->>Email: Send confirmation link
    User->>Angular: Confirm email
    Angular->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/confirm-email
    AuthController->>Handler: ConfirmEmailCommand
    Handler->>Db: Mark email confirmed
    User->>Angular: Login
    Angular->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/login
    AuthController->>Handler: LoginCommand
    alt Two-factor enabled
        Handler->>Db: Store two-factor code hash and expiry
        Handler->>Email: Send code
        Handler-->>Angular: Challenge required
        User->>Angular: Enter code
        Angular->>AuthController: POST /api/auth/verify-2fa
        AuthController->>Handler: VerifyTwoFactorCommand
    end
    Handler->>Db: Store refresh token
    Handler-->>Angular: JWT access token and refresh token
